@startuml

[*] --> Citizen : Register

Citizen --> RegisteredCitizen : Register
RegisteredCitizen --> LoggedInCitizen : Login
LoggedInCitizen --> DocumentUploadInProgress : UploadDocuments
DocumentUploadInProgress --> DocumentUploadInProgress : ContinueUploadingDocuments
LoggedInCitizen --> CertificateRequestInProgress : ApplyForCertificate
CertificateRequestInProgress --> CertificateRequestInProgress : ReapplyForCertificate
Registrar --> RegisteredCitizen : RequestCertificateVerification

CertificateRequestInProgress --> [*] : EndSession
DocumentUploadInProgress --> [*] : EndSession
LoggedInCitizen --> [*] : EndSession

@enduml
